### Week 21
- [ ] Learn kernel debugging (`printk`, `dmesg`)
- [ ] Experiment with `kgdb` or `gdb` on kernel modules
- [ ] Debug previously written driver

### Week 22
- [ ] Study interrupts in detail: IRQ, softirq, bottom halves
- [ ] Write a module handling hardware/software interrupts
- [ ] Mini Project: Button press triggers kernel logging

### Week 23
