- [ ] Build a custom kernel with minimal drivers
- [ ] Boot into your custom kernel in VM

### Week 24
- [ ] Explore device trees and hardware description
- [ ] Write a simple device tree for your MCU board
- [ ] Mini Project: Blink LED using device tree configuration

### Week 25
- [ ] Study dynamic memory allocation in kernel (`kmalloc`, `kfree`)
- [ ] Modify driver to use dynamic memory
- [ ] Test memory allocation under load

### Week 26
- [ ] Consolidate quarter 2 knowledge
- [ ] Combine kernel module + CPU info + device access
- [ ] Document project in Markdown/GitHub

